    "criteria": [
      "Supported intents form two related product families: bank transfers and card payments.",
      "Each family covers different transaction states and failure modes (pending, declined, failed, fees, recognition).",
      "Every supported intent has at least min_supported_class_size examples in the official training split.",
      "Confusable intents are kept deliberately; no intent was removed to make classification easier.",
      "Only published label names, training-split counts, and the training-only EDA were used; the official test split was never opened and no model output was used."
    ]
  },
