  "oos_allocation": {
    "method": "Every non-supported label is placed in one name-based stratum, in this order: hard_<family> (name tokens contain the family anchor token), near (shares any supported-name token other than generic_name_tokens), far (everything else). Name tokens are case-folded alphanumeric runs. Within each stratum labels are sorted by descending training count, then by name, and assigned alternately to validation and final test; the first assignment alternates between strata (validation for strata 1 and 3, final test for strata 2 and 4). Fully deterministic; no randomness is used.",
